doc:sec-5-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "5(2) Terms and conditions of employment (Chapter 2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Part 2-1 has the core provisions for the Chapter. It deals with compliance with, and interaction between, the sources of the main terms and conditions provided under this Act—the National Employment Standards, modern awards and enterprise agreements. Note: Workplace determinations are another source of main terms and conditions. In most cases, this Act applies to a workplace determination as if it were an enterprise agreement in operation (see section 279). Main terms and conditions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer .

