    skos:prefLabel "5(4) Terms and conditions of employment (Chapter 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Part 2-3 is about modern awards. A modern award is made for a particular industry or occupation and provides additional minimum terms and conditions for those national system employees to whom it applies. A modern award can have terms that are ancillary or supplementary to the National Employment Standards." ;
