    skos:prefLabel "6(4) Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Part 3-3 deals mainly with industrial action by national system employees and national system employers and sets out when industrial action is protected industrial action. No action lies under any law in force in a State or Territory in relation to protected industrial action except in certain circumstances." ;
