doc:sec-7-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(2) Compliance and enforcement (Chapter 4)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Part 4-1 is about civil remedies. Certain provisions in this Act impose obligations on certain persons. Civil remedies may be sought in relation to contraventions of these civil remedy provisions. Part 4-1: (a) deals with applications for orders for contraventions of civil remedy provisions; and (b) sets out the orders the courts can make in relation to a contravention of a civil remedy provision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer .

