    skos:prefLabel "9(5B) Miscellaneous (Chapter 6)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9-ss-5b ;
    values:originalText "(5B) Part 6-4B allows a worker who has been bullied at work to apply to the FWC for an order to stop the bullying." ;
