concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15F Meaning of regulated business"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15f ;
    values:originalText "A person is a regulated business if: (a) the person is a digital labour platform operator (see section 15M); or (b) the person is a road transport business (see subsection 15R)." ;
    skos:definition "A person is a regulated business if: (a) the person is a digital labour platform operator (see section 15M); or (b) the person is a road transport business (see subsection 15R)."@en ;
