concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15G Meaning of regulated worker"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15g ;
    values:originalText "A person is a regulated worker if: (a) the person is an employee-like worker (see section 15P); or (b) the person is a regulated road transport contractor (see section 15Q)." ;
    skos:definition "A person is a regulated worker if: (a) the person is an employee-like worker (see section 15P); or (b) the person is a regulated road transport contractor (see section 15Q)."@en ;
