concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-15m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15M Meaning of digital labour platform operator"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15m ;
    values:originalText "A digital labour platform operator means the operator of a digital labour platform, being an operator that enters into or facilitates a services contract under which work is performed by employee-like workers." ;
