concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-22-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22(3) Meanings of service and continuous service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An excluded period does not break a national system employee’s continuous service with his or her national system employer, but does not count towards the length of the employee’s continuous service." ;
    skos:definition "(3) An excluded period does not break a national system employee’s continuous service with his or her national system employer, but does not count towards the length of the employee’s continuous service."@en ;
