doc:sec-23-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23(3) Meaning of small business employer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purpose of calculating the number of employees employed by the employer at a particular time, associated entities are taken to be one entity.  Introduction  Chapter 1 Definitions  Part 1-2 Other definitions  Division 4 Section 23A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-23-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(4) Meaning of small business employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) To avoid doubt, in determining whether a national system employer is a small business employer at a particular time in relation to the dismissal of an employee, or termination of an employee’s employment, the employees that are to be counted include (subject to paragraph (2)(b)): (a) the employee who is being dismissed or whose employment is being terminated; and (b) any other employee of the employer who is also being dismissed or whose employment is also being terminated." ;
    skos:definition "(4) To avoid doubt, in determining whether a national system employer is a small business employer at a particular time in relation to the dismissal of an employee, or termination of an employee’s employment, the employees that are to be counted include (subject to paragraph (2)(b)): (a) the employee who is being dismissed or whose employment is being terminated; and (b) any other employee of the employer who is also being dismissed or whose employment is also being terminated."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6bacc0e4208b052f6966fa98f4ed28b7f24890cfb5983aae18d3cb60db43c54d" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-23 ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employees to be counted in determining small business employer status" ;
