concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30 Act may exclude State and Territory laws etc. in other cases"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30 ;
    values:originalText "This Division is not a complete statement of the circumstances in which this Act and instruments made under it are intended to apply to the exclusion of, or prevail over, laws of the States and Territories or instruments made under those laws.  Chapter 1  Introduction" ;
    skos:definition "This Division is not a complete statement of the circumstances in which this Act and instruments made under it are intended to apply to the exclusion of, or prevail over, laws of the States and Territories or instruments made under those laws.  Chapter 1  Introduction"@en ;
