    skos:prefLabel "30B(3) Meaning of referring State"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) This subsection covers the matters to which the referred provisions relate to the extent of making laws with respect to those matters by  Chapter 1  Introduction" ;
