concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30C Extended meaning of national system employee"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30c ;
    values:originalText "(1) A national system employee includes: (a) any individual in a State that is a referring State because of this Division so far as he or she is employed, or usually employed, as described in paragraph 30D(1)(a), except on a vocational placement; and (b) a law enforcement officer of the State to whom subsection 30E(1) applies. (2) This section does not limit the operation of section 13 (which defines a national system employee). Note: Section 30H may limit the extent to which this section extends the meaning of national system employee." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A national system employee includes: (a) any individual in a State that is a referring State because of this Division so far as he or she is employed, or usually employed, as described in paragraph 30D(1)(a), except on a vocational placement; and (b) a law enforcement officer of the State to whom subsection 30E(1) applies. (2) This section does not limit the operation of section 13 (which defines a national system employee). Note: Section 30H may limit the extent to which this section extends the meaning of national system employee."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "aa8a3409d6e0ef036cbb3c1810672c88bedd1608554f5818d7c43a19d80b356b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30c-ss-1 ;
