    cof:title "30D(1) Extended meaning of national system employer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A national system employer includes: (a) any person in a State that is a referring State because of this Division so far as the person employs, or usually employs, an individual; and (b) a holder of an office to whom subsection 30E(2) applies." ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30d-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30D(2) Extended meaning of national system employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30d-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) This section does not limit the operation of section 14 (which defines a national system employer). Note: Section 30H may limit the extent to which this section extends the meaning of national system employer.  Introduction  Chapter 1 Application of this Act  Part 1-3 Application of this Act in States that refer matters before 1 July 2009  Division 2A Section 30E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(2) This section does not limit the operation of section 14 (which defines a national system employer). Note: Section 30H may limit the extent to which this section extends the meaning of national system employer.  Introduction  Chapter 1 Application of this Act  Part 1-3 Application of this Act in States that refer matters before 1 July 2009  Division 2A Section 30E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "91c464d081975373cc30d4f0b96cc9a42f0a4d553a029accdd8dc589e1bd77fa" ;
