concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30F Extended meaning of outworker entity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30f ;
    values:originalText "(1) An outworker entity includes a person, other than in the person’s capacity as a national system employer, so far as: (a) the person arranges for work to be performed for the person (either directly or indirectly); and (b) the work is of a kind that is often performed by outworkers; and (c) one or more of the following applies: (i) at the time the arrangement is made, one or more parties to the arrangement is in a State that is a referring State because of this Division; (ii) the work is to be performed in a State that is a referring State because of this Division; (iii) the person referred to in paragraph (a) carries on an activity (whether of a commercial, governmental or other nature) in a State that is a referring State because  Chapter 1  Introduction" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An outworker entity includes a person, other than in the person’s capacity as a national system employer, so far as: (a) the person arranges for work to be performed for the person (either directly or indirectly); and (b) the work is of a kind that is often performed by outworkers; and (c) one or more of the following applies: (i) at the time the arrangement is made, one or more parties to the arrangement is in a State that is a referring State because of this Division; (ii) the work is to be performed in a State that is a referring State because of this Division; (iii) the person referred to in paragraph (a) carries on an activity (whether of a commercial, governmental or other nature) in a State that is a referring State because  Chapter 1  Introduction"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c7896d66ea2e0ff7ddc5cfc47466d0b809648194e7bd58bf53f539a6f4ec5f8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines outworker entity" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.141" ;
