doc:sec-1-6-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(3) July 2009 but on or before 1 January 2010, referred the matters" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) This subsection covers the matters to which the referred provisions relate to the extent of making laws with respect to those matters by  Introduction  Chapter 1 Application of this Act  Part 1-3 Application of this Act in States that refer matters after 1 July 2009 but on or before 1 January 2010  Division 2B Section 30L Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 amending this Act, as originally enacted, and as subsequently amended by amendments enacted at any time before the State’s referral law commenced, to include the referred provisions. Reference covering amendments" ;
    cof:pageNumber "148"^^xsd:integer .

