concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30n a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30N Extended meaning of national system employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30n ;
    values:originalText "(1) A national system employer includes: (a) any person in a State that is a referring State because of this Division so far as the person employs, or usually employs, an individual; and (b) a holder of an office to whom subsection 30P(2) applies. (2) This section does not limit the operation of section 14 (which defines a national system employer).  Chapter 1  Introduction" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A national system employer includes: (a) any person in a State that is a referring State because of this Division so far as the person employs, or usually employs, an individual; and (b) a holder of an office to whom subsection 30P(2) applies. (2) This section does not limit the operation of section 14 (which defines a national system employer).  Chapter 1  Introduction"@en ;
