concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30P Extended ordinary meanings of employee and employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30p ;
    values:originalText "(1) A reference in this Act to an employee with its ordinary meaning includes a reference to a law enforcement officer of a referring State if the State’s referral law so provides for the purposes of that law. (2) A reference in this Act to an employer with its ordinary meaning includes a reference to a holder of an office of a State if the State’s referral law provides, for the purposes of that law, that the holder of the office is taken to be the employer of a law enforcement officer of the State. (3) This section does not limit the operation of section 15 (which deals with references to employee and employer with their ordinary meanings). Note: Section 30S may limit the extent to which this section extends the meanings of employee and employer." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A reference in this Act to an employee with its ordinary meaning includes a reference to a law enforcement officer of a referring State if the State’s referral law so provides for the purposes of that law. (2) A reference in this Act to an employer with its ordinary meaning includes a reference to a holder of an office of a State if the State’s referral law provides, for the purposes of that law, that the holder of the office is taken to be the employer of a law enforcement officer of the State. (3) This section does not limit the operation of section 15 (which deals with references to employee and employer with their ordinary meanings). Note: Section 30S may limit the extent to which this section extends the meanings of employee and employer."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "97d6cdb9e36c4190da1e872db4a0e0c9525179c8c3174b6777f7ecb7a906beeb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "152"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30p-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30p-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-30p-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.152" .
