    cml:logicSummary "The CogAI system can infer that the provision does not apply to the person or entity in Australia due to insufficient connection." ;
    cml:premiseText "There is not a sufficient connection between the person or entity and Australia." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The provision should not apply to the person or entity in Australia." ;
    cml:executionSurface "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-31-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31(2) Exclusion of persons etc. insufficiently connected with Australia" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before the Governor-General makes regulations for the purposes of subsection (1) prescribing either or both of the following: (a) a provision of this Act that is not to apply to a person or entity; (b) a person to whom, or an entity to which, a provision of this Act is not to apply; the Minister must be satisfied that the provision should not apply to the person or entity in Australia because there is not a sufficient connection between the person or entity and Australia." ;
    cof:pageNumber "154"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-32 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 Regulations may modify application of this Act in certain parts of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-32 ;
    values:originalText "Australia If the regulations prescribe modifications of this Act for its application in relation to all or part of any one or more of the following areas: (a) all the waters of the sea on the landward side of the outer limits of the territorial sea of Australia, including: (i) such waters within the limits of a State or Territory; and (ii) the airspace over, and the seabed and sub-soil beneath, such waters;  Introduction  Chapter 1 Application of this Act  Part 1-3 Geographical application of this Act  Division 3 Section 32A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) the Territory of Christmas Island; (c) the Territory of Cocos (Keeling) Islands; then this Act has effect as so modified in relation to any such area or part. Note: This Act would, in the absence of any such regulations, apply in relation to these areas in the same way as it applies in relation to the rest of Australia." ;
    skos:definition "Australia If the regulations prescribe modifications of this Act for its application in relation to all or part of any one or more of the following areas: (a) all the waters of the sea on the landward side of the outer limits of the territorial sea of Australia, including: (i) such waters within the limits of a State or Territory; and (ii) the airspace over, and the seabed and sub-soil beneath, such waters;  Introduction  Chapter 1 Application of this Act  Part 1-3 Geographical application of this Act  Division 3 Section 32A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) the Territory of Christmas Island; (c) the Territory of Cocos (Keeling) Islands; then this Act has effect as so modified in relation to any such area or part. Note: This Act would, in the absence of any such regulations, apply in relation to these areas in the same way as it applies in relation to the rest of Australia."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "98124bfc70abc18ea512515e7eb761193c888b50447bc54fbe80ce79d98e0eff" ;
    cof:pageNumber "154"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regulations may modify application of this Act in certain parts of Australia." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
