    skos:prefLabel "33(5) Extension of this Act to the exclusive economic zone and the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of subsection (4), the regulations may prescribe different modifications in relation to different parts of the exclusive economic zone or continental shelf. Extension relating to Greater Sunrise special regime area" ;
