doc:sec-33-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "33(5) Extension of this Act to the exclusive economic zone and the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of subsection (4), the regulations may prescribe different modifications in relation to different parts of the exclusive economic zone or continental shelf. Extension relating to Greater Sunrise special regime area" ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-33-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33(6) Extension of this Act to the exclusive economic zone and the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Despite subsection 13AB(1) of the Seas and Submerged Lands Act 1973: (a) an extension of this Act under subsection (1) of this section has effect; and (b) an extension of this Act, or a provision of this Act, because of regulations made for the purposes of subsection (3) of this section may (subject to those regulations) have effect; in relation to acts, omissions, matters and things directly or indirectly connected with the exploration of, or exploitation of the natural resources of, the continental shelf in the Greater Sunrise special regime area. This subsection has effect whether or not the extension is affected by subsection (4) of this section." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Despite subsection 13AB(1) of the Seas and Submerged Lands Act 1973: (a) an extension of this Act under subsection (1) of this section has effect; and (b) an extension of this Act, or a provision of this Act, because of regulations made for the purposes of subsection (3) of this section may (subject to those regulations) have effect; in relation to acts, omissions, matters and things directly or indirectly connected with the exploration of, or exploitation of the natural resources of, the continental shelf in the Greater Sunrise special regime area. This subsection has effect whether or not the extension is affected by subsection (4) of this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "761767a68e8035cf816a2f0b6037d2e2ee89907477e546429aedae1392e5f22a" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-33 ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Extension of this Act has effect in relation to acts, omissions, matters and things directly or indirectly connected with the exploration of, or exploitation of the natural resources of, the continental shelf in the Greater Sunrise special regime area." ;
