concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-44 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44 Contravening the National Employment Standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "An employer must not contravene a provision of the National Employment Standards. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Subdivision C—Terms and conditions of employment provided by a modern award" ;
    skos:definition "An employer must not contravene a provision of the National Employment Standards. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Subdivision C—Terms and conditions of employment provided by a modern award"@en ;
