concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-51-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51(1) The significance of an enterprise agreement applying to a person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-51-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An enterprise agreement applies to an employee, employer or employee organisation if: (a) the agreement is in operation; and (b) the agreement covers the employee, employer or organisation; and  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An enterprise agreement applies to an employee, employer or employee organisation if: (a) the agreement is in operation; and (b) the agreement covers the employee, employer or organisation; and  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
