concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Interaction between modern awards and enterprise agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A modern award does not apply to an employee in relation to particular employment at a time when an enterprise agreement applies to the employee in relation to that employment. (2) If a modern award does not apply to an employee in relation to particular employment because of subsection (1), the award does not apply to an employer, or an employee organisation, in relation to the employee." ;
