doc:sec-65b-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "65B(3) Disputes about the operation of this Division" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If discussions at the workplace level do not resolve the dispute, a party to the dispute may refer the dispute to the FWC.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 The National Employment Standards  Part 2-2 Requests for flexible working arrangements  Division 4 Section 65C Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-65b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65B(4) Disputes about the operation of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-65b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If a dispute is referred under subsection (3): (a) the FWC must first deal with the dispute by means other than arbitration, unless there are exceptional circumstances; and (b) the FWC may deal with the dispute by arbitration in accordance with section 65C. Note: For the purposes of paragraph (a), the FWC may deal with the dispute as it considers appropriate. The FWC commonly deals with disputes by conciliation. The FWC may also deal with the dispute by mediation, making a recommendation or expressing an opinion (see subsection 595(2)). Representatives" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If a dispute is referred under subsection (3): (a) the FWC must first deal with the dispute by means other than arbitration, unless there are exceptional circumstances; and (b) the FWC may deal with the dispute by arbitration in accordance with section 65C. Note: For the purposes of paragraph (a), the FWC may deal with the dispute as it considers appropriate. The FWC commonly deals with disputes by conciliation. The FWC may also deal with the dispute by mediation, making a recommendation or expressing an opinion (see subsection 595(2)). Representatives"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d741148b1beb4ed45f45f0463a43b1b52207503cc6053fc25b84640f1b6de706" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-65b ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "FWC must deal with dispute by means other than arbitration unless exceptional circumstances." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
