concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-72a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "72A(3) Flexible unpaid parental leave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-72a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The employee must take the flexible unpaid parental leave as: (a) a single continuous period of one or more days; or (b) separate periods of one or more days each. Effect of taking unpaid parental leave under other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The employee must take the flexible unpaid parental leave as: (a) a single continuous period of one or more days; or (b) separate periods of one or more days each. Effect of taking unpaid parental leave under other provisions"@en ;
