doc:sec-72a-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "72A(4) Flexible unpaid parental leave" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The employee may take the flexible unpaid parental leave whether or not the employee has taken unpaid parental leave under another provision of this Division in relation to the child." ;
