concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-74-ss-3c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "74(3C) Notice and evidence requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-74-ss-3c ;
    values:originalText "(3C) If any of the leave covered by the notice is to be taken under section 72A, the notice must specify the total number of days (flexible days) of flexible unpaid parental leave that the employee intends to take in relation to the child." ;
    skos:definition "(3C) If any of the leave covered by the notice is to be taken under section 72A, the notice must specify the total number of days (flexible days) of flexible unpaid parental leave that the employee intends to take in relation to the child."@en ;
