concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-78-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78(1) Employee who ceases to have responsibility for care of child"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-78-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to an employee who has taken unpaid parental leave in relation to a child if the employee ceases to have any responsibility for the care of the child for a reason other than because the child: (a) is stillborn; or (b) dies during the 24-month period starting on the child’s date of birth." ;
