doc:sec-84 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "84 Return to work guarantee" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "On ending a period of unpaid parental leave, an employee is entitled to return to: (a) the employee’s pre-parental leave position; or (b) if that position no longer exists—an available position for which the employee is qualified and suited nearest in status and pay to the pre-parental leave position." ;
