concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-87-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "87(5) Entitlement to annual leave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-87-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Without limiting the way in which a class may be described for the purposes of paragraph (3)(b) or subsection (4), the class may be described by reference to one or more of the following: (a) a particular industry or part of an industry; (b) a particular kind of work; (c) a particular type of employment." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Without limiting the way in which a class may be described for the purposes of paragraph (3)(b) or subsection (4), the class may be described by reference to one or more of the following: (a) a particular industry or part of an industry; (b) a particular kind of work; (c) a particular type of employment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "be658973513e54a6d5097602e0e0cfc4cd08eb1cdc6f9ae55198b37280fce9f1" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-87 ;
    cof:pageNumber "244"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Describes a class for annual leave entitlement" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
