concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-92 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "92 Paid annual leave must not be cashed out except in accordance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-92 ;
    values:originalText "with permitted cashing out terms Paid annual leave must not be cashed out, except in accordance with: (a) cashing out terms included in a modern award or enterprise agreement under section 93, or (b) an agreement between an employer and an award/agreement free employee under subsection 94(1)." ;
    skos:definition "with permitted cashing out terms Paid annual leave must not be cashed out, except in accordance with: (a) cashing out terms included in a modern award or enterprise agreement under section 93, or (b) an agreement between an employer and an award/agreement free employee under subsection 94(1)."@en ;
