doc:sec-94-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "94(5) Cashing out and taking paid annual leave for award/agreement" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) An employer may require an award/agreement free employee to take a period of paid annual leave, but only if the requirement is reasonable. Note: A requirement to take paid annual leave may be reasonable if, for example: (a) the employee has accrued an excessive amount of paid annual leave; or (b) the employer’s enterprise is being shut down for a period (for example, between Christmas and New Year). Agreements about taking paid annual leave" ;
    cof:pageNumber "248"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-94-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "94(6) Cashing out and taking paid annual leave for award/agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-94-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) An employer and an award/agreement free employee may agree on when and how paid annual leave may be taken by the employee. Note: Matters that could be agreed include, for example, the following: (a) that paid annual leave may be taken in advance of accrual; (b) that paid annual leave must be taken within a fixed period of time after it is accrued; (c) the form of application for paid annual leave; (d) that a specified period of notice must be given before taking paid annual leave.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(6) An employer and an award/agreement free employee may agree on when and how paid annual leave may be taken by the employee. Note: Matters that could be agreed include, for example, the following: (a) that paid annual leave may be taken in advance of accrual; (b) that paid annual leave must be taken within a fixed period of time after it is accrued; (c) the form of application for paid annual leave; (d) that a specified period of notice must be given before taking paid annual leave.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "78c2a18a7d4e1910c7ea90ffd03df7af11c0b80274266db8ad6c206c84d8d24a" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-94 ;
    cof:pageNumber "248"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer and employee may agree on when paid annual leave can be taken." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
