concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-115-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "115(3) Meaning of public holiday"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-115-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A modern award or enterprise agreement may include terms providing for an employer and employee to agree on the substitution of a day or part-day for a day or part-day that would otherwise be a public holiday because of subsection (1) or (2). Substituted public holidays for award/agreement free employees" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A modern award or enterprise agreement may include terms providing for an employer and employee to agree on the substitution of a day or part-day for a day or part-day that would otherwise be a public holiday because of subsection (1) or (2). Substituted public holidays for award/agreement free employees"@en ;
