concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-118 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "118 Modern awards and enterprise agreements may provide for"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-118 ;
    values:originalText "notice of termination by employees A modern award or enterprise agreement may include terms specifying the period of notice an employee must give in order to terminate his or her employment. Subdivision B—Redundancy pay" ;
