doc:sec-122-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "122(4) Transfer of employment situations that affect the obligation to" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the FWC is satisfied that subsection (3) operates unfairly to the employee, the FWC may order the first employer to pay the employee a specified amount of redundancy pay (not exceeding the amount that would be payable but for subsection (3)) that the FWC considers appropriate. The first employer must pay the employee that amount of redundancy pay. Subdivision C—Limits on scope of this Division" ;
    cof:pageNumber "282"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-123 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "123 Limits on scope of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-123 ;
    values:originalText "Employees not covered by this Division (1) This Division does not apply to any of the following employees: (a) an employee employed for a specified period of time, for a specified task, or for the duration of a specified season; (b) an employee whose employment is terminated because of serious misconduct; (c) a casual employee;  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "Employees not covered by this Division (1) This Division does not apply to any of the following employees: (a) an employee employed for a specified period of time, for a specified task, or for the duration of a specified season; (b) an employee whose employment is terminated because of serious misconduct; (c) a casual employee;  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8b40121ab63ce369636bc72189f738878a33ec6286ae3d69ca45ee2f8adc9f6c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "283"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employees not covered by this Division" ;
