    cml:logicSummary "Definition of modern award minimum wages in AI systems" ;
    cml:premiseText "For the meanings of modern award minimum wages, and setting and varying such wages, see section 284" ;
    cml:conclusionText "Modern award minimum wages are defined in section 284 for AI systems" ;
