concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-142 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "142 Incidental and machinery terms"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-142 ;
    values:originalText "Incidental terms (1) A modern award may include terms that are: (a) incidental to a term that is permitted or required to be in the modern award; and  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "Incidental terms (1) A modern award may include terms that are: (a) incidental to a term that is permitted or required to be in the modern award; and  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
