concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-143a-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143A(7) Coverage terms of modern enterprise awards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-143a-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of subsections (3) and (4): (a) an employer or employers may be specified by name or by inclusion in a specified class or specified classes; and (b) employees must be specified by inclusion in a specified class or specified classes; and (c) organisations must be specified by name. Employees not traditionally covered by awards etc." ;
    skos:definition "(7) For the purposes of subsections (3) and (4): (a) an employer or employers may be specified by name or by inclusion in a specified class or specified classes; and (b) employees must be specified by inclusion in a specified class or specified classes; and (c) organisations must be specified by name. Employees not traditionally covered by awards etc."@en ;
