    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if: (a) an employee and employer agree to an arrangement that purports to be an individual flexibility arrangement under a flexibility term in a modern award; and (b) the arrangement does not meet a requirement set out in section 144.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 Terms of modern awards  Division 3 Section 145A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note: A failure to meet such a requirement may be a contravention of a provision of Part 3-1 (which deals with general protections). Arrangement has effect as if it were an individual flexibility arrangement" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if: (a) an employee and employer agree to an arrangement that purports to be an individual flexibility arrangement under a flexibility term in a modern award; and (b) the arrangement does not meet a requirement set out in section 144.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 Terms of modern awards  Division 3 Section 145A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note: A failure to meet such a requirement may be a contravention of a provision of Part 3-1 (which deals with general protections). Arrangement has effect as if it were an individual flexibility arrangement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bfec7bafba7b64944eb4d8deb382dc014a45ee153b8d28f50a2dee4dcf767385" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-145 ;
