doc:sec-145-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "145(1) Effect of individual flexibility arrangement that does not meet" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if: (a) an employee and employer agree to an arrangement that purports to be an individual flexibility arrangement under a flexibility term in a modern award; and (b) the arrangement does not meet a requirement set out in section 144.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 Terms of modern awards  Division 3 Section 145A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note: A failure to meet such a requirement may be a contravention of a provision of Part 3-1 (which deals with general protections). Arrangement has effect as if it were an individual flexibility arrangement" ;
