concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-145a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "145A Consultation about changes to rosters or hours of work"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-145a ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting paragraph 139(1)(j), a modern award must include a term that: (a) requires the employer to consult employees about a change to their regular roster or ordinary hours of work; and (b) allows for the representation of those employees for the purposes of that consultation. (2) The term must require the employer: (a) to provide information to the employees about the change; and  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Without limiting paragraph 139(1)(j), a modern award must include a term that: (a) requires the employer to consult employees about a change to their regular roster or ordinary hours of work; and (b) allows for the representation of those employees for the purposes of that consultation. (2) The term must require the employer: (a) to provide information to the employees about the change; and  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "21d44d801b076a6f509af492e59271568ad164f350f0418615366d084686591c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "309"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-145a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-145a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
