concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-151 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151 Terms about payments and deductions for benefit of employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151 ;
    values:originalText "etc. A modern award must not include a term that has no effect because of: (a) subsection 326(1) (which deals with unreasonable deductions for the benefit of an employer); or (b) subsection 326(3) (which deals with unreasonable requirements to spend or pay an amount); or (c) subsection 326(4) (which deals with deductions or payments in relation to employees under 18).  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 Terms of modern awards  Division 3 Section 152 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "etc. A modern award must not include a term that has no effect because of: (a) subsection 326(1) (which deals with unreasonable deductions for the benefit of an employer); or (b) subsection 326(3) (which deals with unreasonable requirements to spend or pay an amount); or (c) subsection 326(4) (which deals with deductions or payments in relation to employees under 18).  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 Terms of modern awards  Division 3 Section 152 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "71414ae56ed8cd1d4e66e93010c38a790608dd82a93b5fc2843e67379c11e24b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "314"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No term with no effect due to subsections 326(1), (3), or (4) can be included in a modern award." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
