concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-152 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152 Terms about right of entry"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152 ;
    values:originalText "A modern award must not include terms that require or authorise an official of an organisation to enter premises: (a) to hold discussions with, or interview, an employee; or (b) to inspect any work, process or object." ;
    skos:definition "A modern award must not include terms that require or authorise an official of an organisation to enter premises: (a) to hold discussions with, or interview, an employee; or (b) to inspect any work, process or object."@en ;
