concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156C Applications to list a standard MySuper product"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156c ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before making the Default Superannuation List, the FWC must publish a notice that invites superannuation funds that offer a standard MySuper product to apply to the FWC to have the product included on the list. (2) The notice must specify the period in which an application may be made. (3) After the notice is published, a superannuation fund that offers a standard MySuper product may make a written application to have the product included on the list. (4) The application must:  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Before making the Default Superannuation List, the FWC must publish a notice that invites superannuation funds that offer a standard MySuper product to apply to the FWC to have the product included on the list. (2) The notice must specify the period in which an application may be made. (3) After the notice is published, a superannuation fund that offers a standard MySuper product may make a written application to have the product included on the list. (4) The application must:  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
