concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156D Submissions on applications to list a standard MySuper"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156d ;
    values:originalText "product (1) The FWC must ensure that all persons and bodies have a reasonable opportunity to make written submissions to the FWC in relation to an application made under subsection 156C(3). (2) If: (a) a person or body makes a written submission in relation to an application made under subsection 156C(3); and (b) the person or body has an interest in relation to: (i) the superannuation fund that made the application; or (ii) if the person or body refers to another superannuation fund in the submission—that superannuation fund; then the person or body must disclose that interest in the submission.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 4 yearly reviews of default fund terms of modern awards  Division 4A Section 156E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (3) The FWC must publish any submission that is made." ;
    skos:definition "product (1) The FWC must ensure that all persons and bodies have a reasonable opportunity to make written submissions to the FWC in relation to an application made under subsection 156C(3). (2) If: (a) a person or body makes a written submission in relation to an application made under subsection 156C(3); and (b) the person or body has an interest in relation to: (i) the superannuation fund that made the application; or (ii) if the person or body refers to another superannuation fund in the submission—that superannuation fund; then the person or body must disclose that interest in the submission.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 4 yearly reviews of default fund terms of modern awards  Division 4A Section 156E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (3) The FWC must publish any submission that is made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a8792157cb4f27fb949c035f45518c61e884bb86e6f420204379c2baa8beb66e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "320"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156d-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156d-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156d-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
