doc:sec-156d-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "156D(2) Submissions on applications to list a standard MySuper" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If: (a) a person or body makes a written submission in relation to an application made under subsection 156C(3); and (b) the person or body has an interest in relation to: (i) the superannuation fund that made the application; or (ii) if the person or body refers to another superannuation fund in the submission—that superannuation fund; then the person or body must disclose that interest in the submission.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 4 yearly reviews of default fund terms of modern awards  Division 4A Section 156E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "320"^^xsd:integer .

