concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156E Determining applications to list a standard MySuper product"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156e ;
    values:originalText "(1) If an application is made under subsection 156C(3) to have a standard MySuper product included on the Default Superannuation List, the FWC must make a determination about whether to include the product on the list. (2) The FWC must not determine that the product is to be included on the list unless, taking into account: (a) the information provided in the application; and (b) the first stage criteria; and (c) any submissions that were made in relation to the application; the FWC is satisfied that including the product on the list would be in the best interests of default fund employees to whom modern awards apply or a particular class of those employees." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If an application is made under subsection 156C(3) to have a standard MySuper product included on the Default Superannuation List, the FWC must make a determination about whether to include the product on the list. (2) The FWC must not determine that the product is to be included on the list unless, taking into account: (a) the information provided in the application; and (b) the first stage criteria; and (c) any submissions that were made in relation to the application; the FWC is satisfied that including the product on the list would be in the best interests of default fund employees to whom modern awards apply or a particular class of those employees."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "27c33e8dcb9e904e8678f2d7b35d41c5e994528d681a482e4a1cb29d44d7f1a8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "321"^^xsd:integer ;
