concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156K Transitional authorisation for certain superannuation funds"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156k ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC may make a transitional authorisation in relation to a superannuation fund (other than a superannuation fund referred to in subsection 149D(1), (1A), (2), (3) or (4)) if, at the time of the 4 yearly review, the FWC is satisfied that it is appropriate to make the authorisation. (2) The transitional authorisation comes into operation on the day it is made and ceases to be in operation on the day specified in the authorisation. Subdivision D—The Schedule of Approved Employer MySuper Products" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The FWC may make a transitional authorisation in relation to a superannuation fund (other than a superannuation fund referred to in subsection 149D(1), (1A), (2), (3) or (4)) if, at the time of the 4 yearly review, the FWC is satisfied that it is appropriate to make the authorisation. (2) The transitional authorisation comes into operation on the day it is made and ceases to be in operation on the day specified in the authorisation. Subdivision D—The Schedule of Approved Employer MySuper Products"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c655077c23d9e1bfa769f58bf88fd7d6ac661f5bcd4fd3a2be9616debc81ebfa" ;
    cof:pageNumber "324"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156k-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156k-ss-2 ;
