concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-156m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156M FWC to invite applications to include employer MySuper"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156m ;
    values:originalText "products on schedule (1) Before making the schedule, the FWC must publish a notice that invites: (a) superannuation funds that offer an employer MySuper product; and (b) employers to which an employer MySuper product relates; to apply to the FWC to have the product included on the schedule. (2) The notice must specify the period in which an application may be made." ;
    skos:definition "products on schedule (1) Before making the schedule, the FWC must publish a notice that invites: (a) superannuation funds that offer an employer MySuper product; and (b) employers to which an employer MySuper product relates; to apply to the FWC to have the product included on the schedule. (2) The notice must specify the period in which an application may be made."@en ;
