    skos:definition "(1) If an application is made under subsection 156N(1) to have an employer MySuper product included on the schedule, the FWC must make a determination about whether to include the product on the schedule.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 4 yearly reviews of default fund terms of modern awards  Division 4A Section 156Q Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note: The FWC must be constituted by an Expert Panel for the purposes of making this determination (see paragraphs 617(4)(d) and (5)(a))."@en ;
