    skos:prefLabel "156T(3) Submissions about the second stage test"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156t-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The FWC must publish any submission that is made.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 4 yearly reviews of default fund terms of modern awards  Division 4A Section 156U Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Subdivision E—Publishing documents under this Division" ;
