    cof:title "157(2) FWC may vary etc. modern awards if necessary to achieve" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The FWC may make a determination varying modern award minimum wages if the FWC is satisfied that: (a) the variation of modern award minimum wages is justified by work value reasons; and (b) making the determination outside the system of annual wage reviews is necessary to achieve the modern awards objective. Note: As the FWC is varying modern award minimum wages, the minimum wages objective also applies (see section 284).  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 Exercising modern award powers  Division 5 Section 158 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "330"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-157-ss-2a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "157(2A) FWC may vary etc. modern awards if necessary to achieve"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-157-ss-2a ;
    values:originalText "(2A) Work value reasons are reasons justifying the amount that employees should be paid for doing a particular kind of work, being reasons related to any of the following: (a) the nature of the work; (b) the level of skill or responsibility involved in doing the work; (c) the conditions under which the work is done." ;
    skos:definition "(2A) Work value reasons are reasons justifying the amount that employees should be paid for doing a particular kind of work, being reasons related to any of the following: (a) the nature of the work; (b) the level of skill or responsibility involved in doing the work; (c) the conditions under which the work is done."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "49682f7f36270f14bb6d2b2fd3e64cf4d134efd6c62e0766892221adcc468632" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-157 ;
    cof:pageNumber "330"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Work value reasons justifying employee pay" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.330" ;
