    values:originalText "(2) The FWC must not make a modern award covering certain employers or employees unless the FWC has considered whether it should, instead, make a determination varying an existing modern award to cover them.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The FWC must not make a modern award covering certain employers or employees unless the FWC has considered whether it should, instead, make a determination varying an existing modern award to cover them.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
