    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-164-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A determination under this Part that varies a modern award (other than a determination that sets, varies or revokes modern award minimum wages) comes into operation on the day specified in the determination. Note 1: For when a modern award, or a revocation of a modern award, comes into operation, see section 49. Note: For when a determination under this Part setting, varying or revoking modern award minimum wages comes into operation, see section 166.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 General provisions relating to modern award powers  Division 6 Section 166 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A determination under this Part that varies a modern award (other than a determination that sets, varies or revokes modern award minimum wages) comes into operation on the day specified in the determination. Note 1: For when a modern award, or a revocation of a modern award, comes into operation, see section 49. Note: For when a determination under this Part setting, varying or revoking modern award minimum wages comes into operation, see section 166.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 General provisions relating to modern award powers  Division 6 Section 166 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8c62d4e7c21d81796f265b1488008deddc74219725bc0b71eb4ce1dceba479b4" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-164 ;
