doc:sec-167-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "167(1) Special rules relating to retrospective variations of awards" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a determination varying a modern award has a retrospective effect because it comes into operation under subsection 165(2) or 166(3) on a day before the day on which the determination is made. No effect on past approval of enterprise agreement or variation" ;
    cof:pageNumber "340"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-167-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "167(2) Special rules relating to retrospective variations of awards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-167-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If, before the determination was made, an enterprise agreement or a variation of an enterprise agreement was approved by the FWC, the validity of the approval is not affected by the retrospective effect of the determination.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 General provisions relating to modern award powers  Division 6 Section 168 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 No creation of liability to pay pecuniary penalty for past conduct" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If, before the determination was made, an enterprise agreement or a variation of an enterprise agreement was approved by the FWC, the validity of the approval is not affected by the retrospective effect of the determination.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Modern awards  Part 2-3 General provisions relating to modern award powers  Division 6 Section 168 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 No creation of liability to pay pecuniary penalty for past conduct"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8775ab8741edad41178e02f41d872322b96b734d6e38e818b4c9a981d55661d8" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-167 ;
    cof:pageNumber "340"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Validity of approval unaffected by retrospective effect" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
