concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-171 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "171 Objects of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-171 ;
    values:originalText "The objects of this Part are: (a) to provide a simple, flexible and fair framework that enables collective bargaining in good faith, particularly at the  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Introduction  Division 1 Section 171 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 enterprise level, for enterprise agreements that deliver productivity benefits; and (b) to enable the FWC to facilitate good faith bargaining and the making of enterprise agreements, including through: (i) making bargaining orders; and (ii) dealing with disputes where the bargaining representatives request assistance; and (iii) ensuring that applications to the FWC for approval of enterprise agreements are dealt with without delay.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "The objects of this Part are: (a) to provide a simple, flexible and fair framework that enables collective bargaining in good faith, particularly at the  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Introduction  Division 1 Section 171 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 enterprise level, for enterprise agreements that deliver productivity benefits; and (b) to enable the FWC to facilitate good faith bargaining and the making of enterprise agreements, including through: (i) making bargaining orders; and (ii) dealing with disputes where the bargaining representatives request assistance; and (iii) ensuring that applications to the FWC for approval of enterprise agreements are dealt with without delay.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a917e3acc9f25cebb62aa6815c931324bec0c7b5d62f95ea39e871269699a3b0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "352"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Objects of this Part are to provide a simple, flexible and fair framework for collective bargaining in good faith." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.352" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-171-norm .
