    skos:definition "(2) If the employer is required by subsection 173(1) (which deals with giving notice of employee representational rights) to take all reasonable steps to give notice in relation to the agreement, the request must not be made until at least 21 days after the day on which the last notice under subsection 173(1) in relation to the agreement is given."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f9817827d6948ca2731db8460bf7b5b6db638008eaeac4989a8aaff10db1857e" ;
