concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-193a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "193A(6) Applying the better off overall test"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-193a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The FWC may only have regard to patterns or kinds of work, or types of employment, if they are reasonably foreseeable at the test time. In considering what is reasonably foreseeable, the FWC must have regard to the nature of the enterprise or enterprises to which the agreement relates." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The FWC may only have regard to patterns or kinds of work, or types of employment, if they are reasonably foreseeable at the test time. In considering what is reasonably foreseeable, the FWC must have regard to the nature of the enterprise or enterprises to which the agreement relates."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "89bece2810fa646f3d8ae25354ee18d848f5a90586489ef91ce9d4a638689dde" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-193a ;
    cof:pageNumber "394"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The FWC must only consider reasonably foreseeable patterns or kinds of work when applying the better off overall test." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
