    cof:title "197(2) Pieceworkers—enterprise agreement includes pieceworker term" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The FWC must be satisfied that the effect of including such a term in the agreement is not detrimental to the employee in relation to  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Approval of enterprise agreements  Division 4 Section 198 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 the entitlements of the employee under the National Employment Standards." ;
    cof:pageNumber "402"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-198 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "198 Pieceworkers—enterprise agreement does not include a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-198 ;
    values:originalText "pieceworker term Application of this section (1) This section applies if: (a) an enterprise agreement that covers an employee does not include a term that defines or describes the employee as a pieceworker; and (b) a modern award that is in operation and covers the employee includes such a term. No detriment test (2) The FWC must be satisfied that the effect of not including such a term in the agreement is not detrimental to the employee in relation to the entitlements of the employee under the National Employment Standards." ;
    skos:definition "pieceworker term Application of this section (1) This section applies if: (a) an enterprise agreement that covers an employee does not include a term that defines or describes the employee as a pieceworker; and (b) a modern award that is in operation and covers the employee includes such a term. No detriment test (2) The FWC must be satisfied that the effect of not including such a term in the agreement is not detrimental to the employee in relation to the entitlements of the employee under the National Employment Standards."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "527823aa307f253c6b3ea5ac21360e6454f25d6a05ef18e671203427acbcd2de" ;
    cof:pageNumber "403"^^xsd:integer ;
