doc:sec-216a-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "216A(5) Variation of supported bargaining agreement to add employer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The variation has no effect unless it is approved by the FWC under section 216AB.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Variation and termination of enterprise agreements  Division 7 Section 216AAA Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 216AAA  Terms of variation must be explained to employees" ;
    cof:pageNumber "426"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-216a-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "216A(1) Variation of supported bargaining agreement to add employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-216a-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before an employer requests under subsection 216A(2) that affected employees approve a proposed variation, the employer must take all reasonable steps to ensure that: (a) the terms of the agreement as proposed to be varied, and the effect of those terms, are explained to the affected employees; and (b) the explanation is provided in an appropriate manner taking into account the particular circumstances and needs of those employees." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Before an employer requests under subsection 216A(2) that affected employees approve a proposed variation, the employer must take all reasonable steps to ensure that: (a) the terms of the agreement as proposed to be varied, and the effect of those terms, are explained to the affected employees; and (b) the explanation is provided in an appropriate manner taking into account the particular circumstances and needs of those employees."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e09e4c59301c2fbfc26aca3a267b7e3f269e2d41e82bd264f8e610393e16235c" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-216a ;
    cof:pageNumber "426"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer and employees may jointly add employer to supported bargaining agreement. Employer must explain proposed variation terms to employees before seeking approval." ;
    dc:description "Explanation of proposed variation terms and their effect" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.426" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-216a-ss-1-norm .
