concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-216dd-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "216DD(3) Determining whether a variation of a single interest"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-216dd-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the FWC refuses to approve a variation of a single interest employer agreement under this section, the FWC may refer the agreement as proposed to be varied to any person or body the FWC considers appropriate.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the FWC refuses to approve a variation of a single interest employer agreement under this section, the FWC may refer the agreement as proposed to be varied to any person or body the FWC considers appropriate.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "84c760afc3aef05b5871ea97541bb62f240755039cc31e9f058257a31b8a832e" ;
