doc:sec-216e-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "216E(5) Variation of multi-enterprise agreement to remove employer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) Before making the request, the employer must:  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Variation and termination of enterprise agreements  Division 7 Section 216EA Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (a) take all reasonable steps to notify the employees of the following: (i) the time and place at which the vote will occur; (ii) the voting method that will be used; and (b) give the employees a reasonable opportunity to decide whether they want to approve the proposed variation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "448"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-216e-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "216E(6) Variation of multi-enterprise agreement to remove employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-216e-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Without limiting subsection (4), the employer may request that the affected employees vote by ballot or by an electronic method. When a variation is made" ;
