concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-219 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "219 Employers and employees may agree to terminate an enterprise"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-219 ;
    values:originalText "agreement Termination by employers and employees (1) The following may jointly agree to terminate an enterprise agreement: (a) if the agreement covers a single employer—the employer and the employees covered by the agreement; or (b) if the agreement covers 2 or more employers—all of the employers and the employees covered by the agreement. Note: For when a termination of an enterprise agreement is agreed to, see section 221.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "agreement Termination by employers and employees (1) The following may jointly agree to terminate an enterprise agreement: (a) if the agreement covers a single employer—the employer and the employees covered by the agreement; or (b) if the agreement covers 2 or more employers—all of the employers and the employees covered by the agreement. Note: For when a termination of an enterprise agreement is agreed to, see section 221.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cbe6914ea70ef13868208d85c00360c7b26e8d1468acf87af17c390baacb69a8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "453"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employers and employees may agree to terminate an enterprise" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
