doc:sec-220-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "220(3) Employers may request employees to approve a proposed" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), the employer may request that the employees vote by ballot or by an electronic method. 221  When termination of an enterprise agreement is agreed to Single-enterprise agreement" ;
