concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-226-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "226(2) Terminating an enterprise agreement after its nominal expiry"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-226-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) This subsection covers a termination of the employment of an employee: (a) at the employer’s initiative because the employer no longer requires the job done by the employee to be done by anyone, except where this is due to the ordinary and customary turnover of labour; or (b) because of the insolvency or bankruptcy of the employer.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(2) This subsection covers a termination of the employment of an employee: (a) at the employer’s initiative because the employer no longer requires the job done by the employee to be done by anyone, except where this is due to the ordinary and customary turnover of labour; or (b) because of the insolvency or bankruptcy of the employer.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "edb34c04f87410afdec38a2a1701a42e480d4ce7840963d9203ffc34c387ed12" ;
