doc:sec-227a-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "227A(4) Application for FWC to reconsider whether an enterprise" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) An employee is covered by this subsection if, on the assumption that the test time mentioned in paragraph 193(4)(b) were the time  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Reconsideration of whether an enterprise agreement passes the better off overall test" ;
