    skos:prefLabel "236(3) Majority support determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-236-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(a), the FWC may work out whether a majority of employees want to bargain using any method the FWC considers appropriate." ;
