doc:sec-236-ss-3a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "236(3A) Majority support determinations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3A) If the agreement will not cover all of the employees of the employer or employers covered by the agreement, the FWC must, in deciding for the purposes of paragraph (2)(c) whether the group of employees who will be covered was fairly chosen, take into account whether the group is geographically, operationally or organisationally distinct. Operation of determination" ;
    cof:pageNumber "476"^^xsd:integer .

