doc:sec-251-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "251(2) Variation of single interest employer authorisations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The FWC must vary the authorisation to remove the employer’s name if: (a) an application has been made under subsection (1); and (b) the requirements of either subsection (2A) or (2B) are met." ;
    cof:pageNumber "496"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-251-ss-2a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "251(2A) Variation of single interest employer authorisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-251-ss-2a ;
    values:originalText "(2A) The requirements of this subsection are met if the FWC is satisfied that: (a) the employers specified in the authorisation and the bargaining representatives of the employees of those employers have had an opportunity to express to the FWC their views (if any) on the application; and (b) because of a change in the employer’s circumstances, it is no longer appropriate for the employer to be specified in the authorisation." ;
    skos:definition "(2A) The requirements of this subsection are met if the FWC is satisfied that: (a) the employers specified in the authorisation and the bargaining representatives of the employees of those employers have had an opportunity to express to the FWC their views (if any) on the application; and (b) because of a change in the employer’s circumstances, it is no longer appropriate for the employer to be specified in the authorisation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "efe725fb2407f9f10b83d5a0a23d937b771a3fa58c2ccc7c81ed2f9bf74593a7" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-251 ;
    cof:pageNumber "496"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employers and employees must express views on single interest employer authorisations." ;
