doc:sec-251-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "251(2A) Variation of single interest employer authorisations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) The requirements of this subsection are met if the FWC is satisfied that: (a) the employers specified in the authorisation and the bargaining representatives of the employees of those employers have had an opportunity to express to the FWC their views (if any) on the application; and (b) because of a change in the employer’s circumstances, it is no longer appropriate for the employer to be specified in the authorisation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "496"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-251-ss-2b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "251(2B) Variation of single interest employer authorisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-251-ss-2b ;
    values:originalText "(2B) The requirements of this subsection are met if: (a) the application was made by a bargaining representative of an employee who will be covered by the proposed enterprise agreement to which the authorisation relates; and (b) the FWC is satisfied that: (i) the employer (the relevant employer) whose name is proposed to be removed employed fewer than 50 employees at the time that the application was made; and (ii) the employers specified in the authorisation and the bargaining representatives of the employees of those employers have had the opportunity to express to the FWC their views (if any) on the application; and (iii) the employees (the relevant employees) who are employed by the relevant employer and that would be covered by the proposed enterprise agreement to which the authorisation relates have, on request by the  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(2B) The requirements of this subsection are met if: (a) the application was made by a bargaining representative of an employee who will be covered by the proposed enterprise agreement to which the authorisation relates; and (b) the FWC is satisfied that: (i) the employer (the relevant employer) whose name is proposed to be removed employed fewer than 50 employees at the time that the application was made; and (ii) the employers specified in the authorisation and the bargaining representatives of the employees of those employers have had the opportunity to express to the FWC their views (if any) on the application; and (iii) the employees (the relevant employees) who are employed by the relevant employer and that would be covered by the proposed enterprise agreement to which the authorisation relates have, on request by the  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a455c546126468a43cb843300ac3477f1142f5e3b315c16e0d5c1b9818489307" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-251 ;
    cof:pageNumber "496"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application must be made by a bargaining representative of an employee who will be covered by the proposed enterprise agreement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
