doc:sec-251a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "251A Restriction on variation of single interest employer" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "authorisation Despite subsection 251(4), the FWC must not vary a single interest employer authorisation if, as a result of the variation, the proposed enterprise agreement to which the authorisation relates would cover employees in relation to general building and construction work.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
