concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-254a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "254A Entitlement for volunteer bodies to make submissions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-254a ;
    values:originalText "(1) A body covered by subsection (2) is entitled to make a submission for consideration in relation to a matter before the FWC if: (a) the matter arises under this Part; and (b) the matter affects, or could affect, the volunteers of a designated emergency management body. (2) The bodies are as follows: (a) a body corporate that: (i) has a history of representing the interests of the designated emergency management body’s volunteers; and (ii) is not prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this subparagraph; (b) any other body that is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph. (3) Subsection (1) applies whether or not the FWC holds a hearing in relation to the matter." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A body covered by subsection (2) is entitled to make a submission for consideration in relation to a matter before the FWC if: (a) the matter arises under this Part; and (b) the matter affects, or could affect, the volunteers of a designated emergency management body. (2) The bodies are as follows: (a) a body corporate that: (i) has a history of representing the interests of the designated emergency management body’s volunteers; and (ii) is not prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this subparagraph; (b) any other body that is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph. (3) Subsection (1) applies whether or not the FWC holds a hearing in relation to the matter."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fb84563a53acddfcd1d548541c07751a9e2c25fd2c973aedf62bb3a71ce3db9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "504"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-254a-ss-1 ;
