concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-257 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "257 Enterprise agreements may incorporate material in force from"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-257 ;
    values:originalText "time to time etc. Despite section 46AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, an enterprise agreement may incorporate material contained in an instrument or other writing: (a) as in force at a particular time; or  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Other matters  Division 11 Section 257 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) as in force from time to time." ;
    skos:definition "time to time etc. Despite section 46AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, an enterprise agreement may incorporate material contained in an instrument or other writing: (a) as in force at a particular time; or  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Enterprise agreements  Part 2-4 Other matters  Division 11 Section 257 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) as in force from time to time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "47478116533da851b3d82b338f6fc4b6d6437e5f3dbb156a705ce7366ddb21c8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "506"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Enterprise agreements may incorporate material in force from time to time." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
